Keep a public name pointing at this router

Usage:
  olr dial [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Start keeping a public name pointing at this router
  rm          Stop keeping a name current
  set         Change a name olr keeps current
  show        Show the names olr keeps current
  status      Show when each name was last checked and last published

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for dial

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr dial [command] --help" for more information about a command.
